  "description": "39 Elm Mount Close, Beaumont, Dublin 9\nExceptional 3-Bedroom Family Home with Sun-Filled South-Facing Garden in a Prime Cul-de-Sac Setting\n\nTucked away in a quiet, mature cul-de-sac, No. 39 Elm Mount Close is a superb three-bedroom semi-detached residence that combines generous living space with an enviable location in the heart of Beaumont. This is a home that has been lovingly maintained over the years and now presents an outstanding opportunity for discerning buyers to modernise and create a truly special long-term family home.\n\nFrom the moment you arrive, the appeal is clear. A private driveway provides convenient off-street parking, while the peaceful setting offers a sense of privacy rarely found so close to the city.\n\nInternally, the property is bright, well-proportioned, and highly functional. The ground floor offers excellent living space, with two separate reception rooms that provide flexibility for modern family life—whether as a formal sitting room, a playroom, home office, or an open-plan reconfiguration (subject to planning). The kitchen, positioned to the rear, enjoys a pleasant outlook over the garden and offers clear potential for extension to create a contemporary kitchen/dining space.\n\nUpstairs, there are three well-sized bedrooms, each benefiting from good natural light, along with a centrally located family bathroom. The layout is practical and easily adaptable to suit a variety of needs.\n\nOne of the standout features of this home is the beautifully oriented south-facing rear garden. This private outdoor space is flooded with sunlight throughout the day, making it ideal for entertaining, gardening, or simply relaxing. It also offers excellent scope for future expansion, should one wish to extend the property.\nElm Mount Close is widely regarded as one of Beaumont’s most established and sought-after residential enclaves. The area is particularly popular with families thanks to its quiet surroundings, strong sense of community, and proximity to excellent amenities.\n\nWithin walking distance of well-regarded primary and secondary schools, including Elm Mount Montessori\nJust minutes from Beaumont Hospital and Dublin City University (DCU)\nClose to Artane Shopping Centre, local cafés, and everyday conveniences\nExcellent recreational facilities nearby, including Rockfield Park and its tennis club\nSuperb transport links, with frequent bus services to the city centre\nEasy access to the M1, M50, and Dublin Airport\n\nThis is a rare opportunity to acquire a solid, well-located home with immense potential in a highly desirable part of Dublin 9. Properties in this cul-de-sac seldom come to market, making this an ideal choice for first-time buyers, growing families, or those looking to trade up.",
